docs {
  ## List API Clients
  
  Bruno: `admin/List API Clients`
  
  Lists every API client (active and revoked). `apiSecret` is always `null` here — it's only
  ever returned once, on `Create API Client`'s response. `lastUsedAt` updates on every
  successful authenticated request from that client, so this doubles as a quick way to check
  whether a given integration is actually calling in.
  
  Code source: `ApiClientControllerImpl.getAllApiClients` / `ApiClientServiceImpl.getAllApiClients`.
}
